t yield' is written underneath.]\n</p><p><br>\nSteed: Stallion K3\n</p><p>Status: ['Healthy' is stricken through.] Butchered\n</p><p>Yield: 43 stone\n</p><p><br>\nSteed: Mare A2\n</p><p>Status: ['Healthy' is stricken through.] Butchered\n</p><p>Yield: 40 stone\n</p><p><br>\nSteed: Stallion K1\n</p><p>Status: ['Diseased' is stricken through.] Butchered\n</p><p>Yield: 35 stone\n</p><p><br>\nTotal delivered to <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> food stores: 118 stone.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715071311\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23795/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6168/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935565/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.064      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.064      1 -total\n 49.67%   18.908      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.59%   16.591     15 Template:Trim\n 23.61%    8.985      2 Template:Uid\n 16.72%    6.363      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.98%    5.323      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.62%    4.041      1 Template:Books\n 10.08%    3.835      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.93%    3.780      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12789-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715071311 and revision id 328259. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}